In CAPENDYR.DAT the action Convtotl Tony was having the problem that he 
couldn't delete transactions while searching through the table.  I have 
written a 'C' action called DELOPROD (DELete Old PRODucts) to replace the
section of code :-

    V[0] = FREC                                :search type
    if(stsrchp(catotal,1,V[0]))                :delete old products
    {
        SETDSKEY(caprod,catotal.category,catotal.type,catotal.code)
                                            :search for each product
        if(!stsrchp(caprod,3,FREC))            :must be an old product
        {
:errline("Convtotl:Del:CTC" S+ catotal.category S+ catotal.type S+ catotal.code,9)
            stdelrec("catotal")                :delete old product total line
            V[0] = FREC                        :restart search from top
        }
        else                                :found the product
        {
            V[0] = NREC
        }
    }

it should now be :-

    catotal.id=1                : week 1
    BLDSLIST(catotal,1,1)       : select records
    DELOPROD                    : delete records with no "caprod" entry

I think the data I took from Tony's machine had already been set to 95/96
so I couldn't test this code, but it should work!

